Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 13:55:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Backlog: fully scope Melee/Ranged/Caster hero roles +
 Training system

Documentation only, no code -- resolves the open questions on the
existing backlog entry through several rounds of feedback:
- Scope: raid party composition only, not board/chain success math
- Native roles per class, Gladiator -> Ranged (confirmed via sprite art)
- Training: two-tier cost (higher one-time unlock per role, small
  repeatable swap cost between already-unlocked roles)
- First-draft roleFlavors naming table (9 classes x 3 roles)
- RaidDef.requiredRoles (per-raid configurable minimums) + raid UI
  spec (DifficultyCircle-style role circles with a green check overlay)
- DevTool coverage: new roles.json content type (reuses the existing
  icon picker, zero new backend code), plus two new small field types
  for roleFlavors and requiredRoles

Ready to build whenever it reaches the front of the queue; no code
changes needed to any other file for this entry alone.
